# n-service-clickhouse-sink — this piece's own operational targets.
#
# Included by the root Makefile (`include n-service-clickhouse-sink/Makefile`),
# so every target here runs from the repository root, against the shared
# master .env — never `cd n-service-clickhouse-sink && make`. What this
# component is and how to verify it: README.md.
#
# Nothing here yet: this service has no randomness of its own — it enriches
# and batch-inserts what the other services already produced — so it is
# unlikely to need much beyond what `make profile` (root Makefile) already
# covers.
